	 * This function implements the 32-bit version of FNV-1.
	 * It is equivalent to hash( 'fnv132', ... ) in PHP, except
	 * its output is base 36 rather than hex.
	 * See <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fowler–Noll–Vo_hash_function>
